#ASSERT `Regs related provision 2009 c 30 s 6 the increase in the number of weeks` (`test years` 0 0 0 0 10 11) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `Regs related provision 2009 c 30 s 6 the number of weeks of benefits deemed to apply` TRUE 10 (YMD 2010 8 20) (`test years` 0 0 0 0 0 13) 41 EQUALS JUST 46

